---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { CONTACT_EMAIL } from '../consts';
---

<PageLayout
  title="Your Quote Information | Cleaning by Cassi"
  description="How the Cleaning by Cassi quote form uses your information."
>
  <h1>Your quote information</h1>
  <p>
    The quote form asks for your name, email and phone number so Cassi can
    respond. Home details, cleaning preferences and scheduling information help
    prepare your personalized quote.
  </p>
  <h2>What happens when you submit?</h2>
  <p>
    Cloudflare Turnstile checks the submission for spam. Resend sends your
    request to Cassi by email and attempts to send you a confirmation. Your
    contact information and the details you enter are included in these emails.
  </p>
  <p>
    Please avoid including passwords, access codes or other sensitive
    information in the form.
  </p>
  <h2>Questions or corrections</h2>
  <p>
    To ask about information you submitted or request a correction or deletion, <a
      href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>contact Cassi</a
    >.
  </p>
</PageLayout>
